==============================================================================
THE SHARED CONTRACT  --  archs/_shared/standard.yaml
==============================================================================
  weight precision      : 8b   (the protected payload)
  activation precision  : 8b
  accumulator policy    : paper_native
                          per architecture, as published. Partial-sum
                          width is a design property; equalising it
                          would equalise the architectures.
  packing rule          : dense_bytes
                          a level holds floor(physical_bits / operand_bits)
                          operands, applied to EVERY level of EVERY design
  technology            : 45nm  (logic and DRAM)
  DRAM                  : LPDDR4, 64b word, 8b operand, depth 1,048,576

